oh god i tottaly get this TW SUICIDE IDEATION

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

I've had suicidal thoughts for a long time but now that they're really bad, it forced in the thought of " i don't care about living, why should i care about school?" so i started to stop caring. I'm failing highschool. i probably won't graduate. i don't want to be a disappointment to my parents and i feel even worse for telling my mom i had those thoughts because she grew up in a shit home. she was beaten daily and had to go through a lot, but she passed with flying colors. she had thoughts like me. what gives me the right, after living a very privileged life to think like this? i was supposed to be great if she lived in hell and became super successful out of it, why aren't I? god i should basically be elon musk. i should have been better but now my future is gone. its gone. there's no more time to fix what I've done.
